Z||000002||Dave Gunsul||04-20-2001||08:13 PM||||I agree. Pias sells the hyper. pistons but<BR>they're at 9.1:1 comp. and that's to much<BR>for the turbo unless you go with a lot less<BR>boost, which wouldn't be worth the money.<BR>If you do go with custom pistons go with<BR>forged they will hold up a lot better than the hyper's.<BR>You might be able to get away with the 9.1:1 comp. if you got some kind of intercooler but<BR>you'd be taking an expensive risk.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
